# signal - Aiki signal semantics over host signal capability

@func watch
@template "watch(...signals)"
@help "Returns a receive-only channel carrying portable signal symbols such as :interrupt and :terminate."

@func stop
@template "stop(source)"
@help "Stops a signal source returned by watch."

@func send
@template "send(process, signal)"
@help "Sends a portable signal such as :interrupt or :terminate to a started process."
